23:   * replacing the `&' with `|' ships ROTL64(rS,SH) | MASK(MB,63), an OR where the
24:     architecture says AND -- 126 of 190 cells wrong.  That is the M_NAIVE leg.
25:   * deleting the `& tmp2' outright, ON THE FIXED CODE, ships ROTL64 ALONE with the
26:     mask IGNORED -- 16/19, measured as M_NOMASK by the pass-2 seat.  (Before the fix
27:     it would have shipped the OR, because the mask was in `tmp'; witness_naive.out
28:     measured THAT function, not this one.)
