144: 
145:        *** THE WRAPPING BRANCH IS A UNION.  An INTERSECTION is EMPTY whenever b > e,
146:        which is exactly the all-zero mask :4031 says cannot exist -- and that was this
147:        file's want_rldimi for 2016 of 4096 (MB, SH) pairs.  See
