codex
The current handlers match the supplied diff. The `rldimi` loop appears to handle the full-wrap boundary correctly. The probe explicitly excludes both instructions, so a green result would not validate either fix.

I’m checking one distinction closely: a 32-bit implementation and a 64-bit processor running in 32-bit mode are different architectural cases.
